{"id":"a1-u04","level":"a1","order":4,"title":{"en":"Society","fr":"La société","es":"La sociedad","ar":"المجتمع"},"tip":{"en":"To talk about social issues, use cause and effect: 'unemployment leads to inequality' or 'as a result of the reform'. Keep a neutral tone.","fr":"Pour parler des problèmes de société, employez la cause et la conséquence : « le chômage entraîne des inégalités » ou « à la suite de la réforme ». Gardez un ton neutre.","es":"Para hablar de problemas sociales, usa la causa y el efecto: «el desempleo provoca desigualdad» o «a raíz de la reforma». Mantén un tono neutro.","ar":"للحديث عن القضايا الاجتماعية استعمل السبب والنتيجة: «تؤدي البطالة إلى اللامساواة» أو «نتيجة للإصلاح». حافظ على نبرة محايدة."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a1-u04-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"government, parliament, law","fr":"gouvernement, parlement, loi","es":"gobierno, parlamento, ley","ar":"حكومة، برلمان، قانون"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u04-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"vote, citizen, democracy","fr":"vote, citoyen, démocratie","es":"voto, ciudadano, democracia","ar":"تصويت، مواطن، ديمقراطية"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"justice, equality, inequality","fr":"justice, égalité, inégalité","es":"justicia, igualdad, desigualdad","ar":"عدالة، مساواة، عدم المساواة"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u04-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"welfare, education, healthcare","fr":"protection sociale, éducation, santé publique","es":"bienestar social, educación, sanidad","ar":"رعاية اجتماعية، تعليم، رعاية صحية"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"integration, discrimination, prejudice","fr":"intégration, discrimination, préjugé","es":"integración, discriminación, prejuicio","ar":"اندماج، تمييز، حكم مسبق"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u04-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"solidarity, volunteer, charity","fr":"solidarité, bénévole, association caritative","es":"solidaridad, voluntario,